tLB25qnfrx7mLiIAYfeoXLFIsXrpz5XqQ&oe=6AB68B9B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled(1)(1).png", "id": "2087130625540636", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_2087130628873969_7866446366568667079_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Kf8Cj190MsQ7kNvwHOX5O3&_nc_oc=AdpWSdZ4jUb1LhuUF-bObufbRvEKC1jxPWVX3XLExhf5IAF-FwWxE86H5TO6Yvwgakw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL3Ok1U5wildf5FC5ILmIEqmR5dqnLZ-4oET2jh-hgiUg&oe=6AB67072"}, "display_name": "Web Weaver", "keywords": ["swinging", "web", "parkour", "grapple", "movement"], "long_description": "**WEB WEAVER**\n\nSwing. Flail. Faceplant. Repeat.\n\nGrab a web, launch yourself off a skyscraper, and pray your aim was better than your judgment. Web Weaver is a physics-based web-swinging parkour game where every jump is one bad grip away from glorious disaster - and it's even funnier with friends.\n\n{1590796759424065}\n\n**BRING FRIENDS (IT'S FUNNIER)**\n\n Multiplayer mayhem. Swing together, knock each other off course, race through the city, or just dangle around being menaces. Everything is better with a squad of googly-eyed disasters.\n\n{1566776888280050}\n\n**SWING THROUGH THE CITY**\n\n Fully physics-driven web-swinging. No rails, no autopilot \u2014 just you, your grip, and gravity doing exactly what it wants. Nail a perfect arc between rooftops and feel like a god. Miss by a hair and eat pavement. Both are great.\n\n{1045542848436579}\n\n**DODGE THE CHAOS**\n\n Lasers. Obstacles. Traps that appear right where you were about to grab. The city is actively trying to end you, and the parkour gets meaner the deeper you go.\n\n{2230945841053332}\n\n**Grab a web. Get moving. Try not to scream.**", "short_description": "Physics-based web-swinging parkour. Dodge lasers, chain wild arcs, faceplant gloriously, and cause chaos with friends."}]}, "developer_name": "AP Development", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "